WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:01.365
On your Windows Open command prompt.

2
00:00:01.905 --> 00:00:03.125
I'm on Mac. I'll open the terminal.

3
00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:05.605
If you have installed A-W-S-C-L-S successfully,

4
00:00:05.745 --> 00:00:07.245
you should see this window.

5
00:00:07.245 --> 00:00:10.045
Type a W SEN version on Windows.

6
00:00:10.105 --> 00:00:12.125
It may show different on Mac. It shows this.

7
00:00:12.435 --> 00:00:15.165
Next, you'll type AWS configure.

8
00:00:15.545 --> 00:00:16.765
Now open the access key file

9
00:00:16.765 --> 00:00:18.085
that you have on your downloads folder.

10
00:00:18.825 --> 00:00:20.955
So I have my own open here.

11
00:00:21.095 --> 00:00:23.235
I'm gonna copy the access key Id. Select this.

12
00:00:23.365 --> 00:00:27.835
Right click copy. Right click paste. Here, enter. Next.

13
00:00:27.935 --> 00:00:30.115
I'm gonna paste the access key.

14
00:00:31.425 --> 00:00:32.875
I'll grab the access key from the file.

15
00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:37.035
Again, select this right click.

16
00:00:37.705 --> 00:00:41.605
Copy right here. Paste it. Enter.

17
00:00:42.115 --> 00:00:45.365
Very important. Choose US East one.

18
00:00:45.365 --> 00:00:48.405
No matter where you're in the world, choose US East one.

19
00:00:48.405 --> 00:00:50.325
This is critical for our hands-on.

20
00:00:50.325 --> 00:00:53.685
To go smoothly, choose US east one only always

21
00:00:54.225 --> 00:00:57.325
for our hands-on, and then click on enter again.

22
00:00:57.455 --> 00:01:01.085
Click enter. We have now configured A-W-S-C-L-I on our

23
00:01:01.085 --> 00:01:01.325
system.
